{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_title", "source_sha256": "b501f82b187f9f5cceb8735c77eee622f0a827ac94f5d7137403bffa6f6691f4", "ja": "ホームラン☆スマイル", "zh": "全垒打☆笑容", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3241b08c0f4f6d176c99dda0aa107d1f868d253bcf61272e49287990190e7d2a", "ja": "アイドルっぽくカワイイ公演にしたい、と\n張りきる昴。応援するメンバー達。本番前、\n昴は緊張から練習した内容を忘れてしまうが\nプロデューサーから可愛いは身についている\nと励まされ、笑顔でステージに向かう。", "zh": "昴鼓足干劲想展现充满偶像风格的可爱公演，\n其他演出成员也为她加油。在正式演出前，\n昴紧张到忘了练习过的内容，但制作人鼓励\n昴说她早已培养出可爱的气质，昴才带着笑容\n迈向舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b8fc37e0b9f44b97a10f2548908b0dde2bbc69fc4ab8d3224ea1b73ebcdd3fb4", "ja": "（昴のセンター公演が終わった。ステージ上の昴に、\nお客さんから大きな拍手が送られている……）", "zh": "（昴的Center公演落幕了，\n观众对舞台上的昴送上了热烈的掌声……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "c5099f30c5c9843dcc7f4496bc3f463edab7cc5855291fd15299fc65c2e81ec0", "ja": "みんな～！　今日はオレのセンター公演に来てくれて、\nホントにありがとうな～っ！", "zh": "大家～！\n真的很谢谢你们今天来参加我的Center公演～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "516c0b5b0b17d79d3608857e09058697b30fab4d2ae57a606d6a3ed2c1fa3269", "ja": "オレ、今日はみんなの前でかわいく喋ろうと思って、\n練習してきたんだけど……緊張して忘れちゃった！", "zh": "我今天原本想在大家面前用可爱的方式说话，\n还练习了好久……但一紧张就忘记了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "e23eb2c3a5f33ea74dc90f31bed52676f53ab2a81eec3ca06abc2711c49ffdb5", "ja": "でも、なんかオレらしいステージになった気がする！\nあとは……。", "zh": "不过，感觉今天的表演应该很有我的风格吧！\n最后就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1004_audience", "source_sha256": "8d4538e6988ee44c465f38387613b75a0134422e460ce271f246292fc75b6a2a", "ja": "あとはー！？", "zh": "就是──！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "13df306111378602a5ccdd9097ae0121e67d6011815f54de9b05a582e453bf9f", "ja": "あとは……みんなが、オレのコト、ちょっとでも\nかわいいって思ってくれたらいいなー、なんて♪", "zh": "就是……要是大家觉得我有那么一点可爱就好了～\n开玩笑的啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1006_audience", "source_sha256": "b056a177a628ec3cf00f2386a267aa54003427df83126f15c125259df50420d5", "ja": "昴ちゃーん！！", "zh": "小昴──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1007_audience", "source_sha256": "1cd4da322aa5fe1a23da8424f0cb8fc48b16e00dea8ff7228aaafbc09fa25103", "ja": "可愛いーっ！！！", "zh": "超可爱──！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "67f832ddc0b3fc02047b30048597f83b840116ba3d8eaca6b2cfbe82995ddf09", "ja": "マジで！？　えへへっ……。\nみんな、サンキュなー！", "zh": "真的吗！？嘿嘿……\n谢谢大家啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1009_audience", "source_sha256": "f9cea876d8104cfaa30cf1feecde3545abfae46183b83d4793dffe0d09c4112f", "ja": "ワァーーー！", "zh": "哗啊────！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "95ff70b1adf6885c2f6da243b018ed4e208a095956fa5429e588d6c112c79bb9", "ja": "{$P$}、ただいま！\nやったよ、オレ！", "zh": "{$P$}，我回来了！\n我做到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "6eb284d3db5de219325692488a1a9648bf03af0843664a7724d949665f01b5e3", "ja": "逆転満塁ホームラン……になったかどうかは\nわからないけど、いいのが打てた気がする！", "zh": "虽然不知道算不算逆转满贯全垒打……\n但应该打得还不错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1012_p", "source_sha256": "3dfce08617769c5412c4e6e12905caa2b87800638f689931ab2b2cdd58760574", "ja": "お疲れさま、昴！　大丈夫だ。\n文句なしの、満塁ホームランだったよ！", "zh": "辛苦了，昴！没问题的，\n你打了一支完美的满贯全垒打喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "01481312a29b39e5206c4f7dc653e53863d6963916950dde13d5a9318e651459", "ja": "ホントか！？\nへへっ……うれしいなー！", "zh": "真的吗！？\n嘿嘿……好开心喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "4fe5ca416c13b9ff133f17bc7e042614dc7c17647274240781f2707a6f325181", "ja": "お疲れさま、昴！　お客さん超盛り上がってたね！\nすっごい熱かったー！", "zh": "辛苦你了，昴！观众的气氛超热烈呢！\n好热血喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1015_025roc", "source_sha256": "9192a52ef96da51cf02de4067a91f6bb71c421988e3dc9431d950d68619176a2", "ja": "ワンダフルで、エクセレントなステージでしたよ！\nスバルのキュートさが、みんなに伝わったと思います♪", "zh": "这是一场Wonderful又Excellent的表演喔！\n大家一定都感受到昴的Cute了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "3a6873b87c01e0f609105e6a6b9fe60f20aa95f6d8aa9efcc6203ba6ae51f2e4", "ja": "のり子、ロコ！　それに美也、千鶴も……\nみんな、ホントにサンキュな！", "zh": "法子、ROCO！还有美也和千鹤……\n真是太谢谢大家了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "b222964d1b0fa0c69a0767ef7aa4643a6a182e2d6a624d35deb3bea372e543b9", "ja": "オレ、緊張でいろいろ吹っ飛んじゃってさ～。\n結局いつものオレだったけど、ま、いっか！", "zh": "虽说我紧张到忘了一大堆事情～\n最后还是用原本的样子上场，不过就算了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1018_042miy", "source_sha256": "bd1d79e02401d0262681b198537448c05e8b668ecc700154953469cd56d49941", "ja": "昴ちゃんは昴ちゃんのままで、素敵でした～。\nお客さんは、みんなわかっていましたよ～。", "zh": "小昴你维持着原本的样子就很棒啰～\n观众心里都明白的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1019_038chz", "source_sha256": "7598ecca1e7d265473e0b60082261a19e620fbdd81c9362ac483d9dc89e30a45", "ja": "ええ。大事なのは、言葉遣いではないのですね……\nわたくしも、学ぶところがありましたわ。", "zh": "没错，重点不在于怎么说话呢……\n本小姐也学到了一课。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1020_p", "source_sha256": "3b53e58168cdbe49853e95d371af0911ee4f284b3296f9eddee8cdbf563cbe38", "ja": "みんなも、お疲れさま！\n着替えてきたら、打ち上げに行こう。", "zh": "大家都辛苦了！\n换好衣服后我们就去庆功宴吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1021_043nor", "source_sha256": "7a7b0fd13fd07a8d58b794bf8e34887ea4f8061d6f020063ead8ce37933f01fb", "ja": "やった！　アタシ、焼肉がいいな～。\nみんな、着替えてこよっ！", "zh": "太好了！我想吃烧肉～\n各位，我们快去换衣服吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1022_025roc", "source_sha256": "04c06414103e32a21904f668b7122e82d4dd0015a760c065cdb310f1503301c2", "ja": "ノリコは本当に焼肉が好きですね……\nロコはもうちょっと軽い、ライトミールがいいです。", "zh": "法子真的很爱烧肉呢……\nROCO倒是比较想吃清爽一点的Light meal。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1023_042miy", "source_sha256": "f53820d7ca41681107f2128f4e2151a6bc071879c1b45550b79ffe660f923385", "ja": "焼肉と軽食……両立するのは難しそうですね～。\n千鶴さん、どうしたらいいと思いますか～？", "zh": "烧肉和轻食……似乎很难兼顾呢～\n千鹤姊，你觉得该怎么办才好～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1024_038chz", "source_sha256": "e7551e564f64dcbe82d227c752d3f90a97d3cab2b84859ddc24148256aae82cc", "ja": "わ、わたくし！？　そ、そうですわね……\nビュッフェ！　ビュッフェなんていかがかしら？", "zh": "本、本小姐吗！？这、这个嘛……\nBuffet！吃Buffet怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1025_042miy", "source_sha256": "9fddc4d9d5aa6ca7b504ada027d1dcd76d1eeec2bccd3225c68f464fba5a06f4", "ja": "お～、それなら、好きなものが食べられますね～。\nさすが千鶴さんですな～。", "zh": "喔～这样的话就能吃到自己喜欢的东西了呢～\n真不愧是千鹤姊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1026_p", "source_sha256": "db43279dc8c11172f38dcce3798e4491e8220a69b0e8cf2ee9d7f1c91a8112d8", "ja": "昴も行かないのか？", "zh": "昴不去换衣服吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1027_047sub", "source_sha256": "a77cc6f502a851c46566505942126668b56678d7da2e718858343ce1ace1945d", "ja": "うん……えっと、{$P$}。\n今日はホントのホントにありがとな！", "zh": "嗯……那个，{$P$}，\n今天真的真的很谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1028_047sub", "source_sha256": "fea27883080272f7894ab886943679f33f432c6e8914dcf506c2d9ec1ea12cea", "ja": "オレ、緊張でいろいろ吹っ飛んじゃったとき、\nもうダメだって思ったんだけど……。", "zh": "我紧张到忘了一大堆事情的时候，\n还以为今天完蛋了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1029_047sub", "source_sha256": "ccbef59f5b6cf2a5699d02675db54d5671cab3d4382ccbdbff09eb9410e18ca4", "ja": "{$P$}がいたから、逃げないで、\n最後まで試合に……ステージに立てたんだ！", "zh": "但因为有{$P$}在，我才没逃避，\n在比赛……在舞台上坚持到最后！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1030_p", "source_sha256": "98fae607204ffd11f5ea1a0ecdc8a7a7840c4e2dafcabfebf87231b6658a9cb0", "ja": "昴……。", "zh": "昴……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1031_047sub", "source_sha256": "5eb4080a7e084a38589d02405e216cbe0b97d3f06c124aa9ecbda234095ae74e", "ja": "それにあの時、{$P$}が\n「笑って」って言ってくれなかったらさ。", "zh": "而且，要是那时{$P$}\n没提醒我要露出笑容的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1032_047sub", "source_sha256": "4ea88da4d526bad6e54463f77354b206cdd9b350df882f97ff3811c87f091740", "ja": "オレ、笑顔を忘れたままステージに立ってたかも。\nそんなの、ちっともオレらしくないよな？", "zh": "我说不定就会忘记笑容，直接站上舞台了。\n那样的话，就一点都不像我了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1033_p", "source_sha256": "1c36f70a9a1002a612e4c87db3277728a801038ba9ce9a3bbc3ab834169ae7a2", "ja": "ああ。笑顔は、昴の一番の武器だ。\nすごく可愛いからな！", "zh": "没错，笑容是昴最强大的武器，\n很可爱的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1034_047sub", "source_sha256": "3b4d0b236c2cdd3f7c798fef94bc364a42a0509f9735e343fcc7f7de65298ec9", "ja": "へへ……なんかハズいけど、そうなのかも。\nお客さんも、かわいいって言ってくれたし……♪", "zh": "嘿嘿……虽然觉得很害羞，但你说的或许没错。\n观众也都说我很可爱……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1035_047sub", "source_sha256": "be3453f1ea962fc0189bf8756ac6a128f188369d5cc722c05cad8ff979e9ce82", "ja": "ありがとな、{$P$}！　オレ、\n次の試合……じゃなかった、ステージもがんばるよ！", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}！\n下一场比赛……不，是下一场表演，我也会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1036_p", "source_sha256": "037f34c35dbf13d186487927f86022bc940d7ad1b1f11054c7b0b35de8e2e511", "ja": "（そう言って笑った昴の笑顔は、\nいつもより一層、輝いて見えた）", "zh": "（笑着这么说的昴，\n笑容看起来比平常更加闪闪发光。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_038_1037_p", "source_sha256": "40df2c2db1122992490b347efcd1e3ffef22c3a006bfa8a1bd44290722e14f36", "ja": "（昴はセンター公演を経て、また一つ成長した……\n大きく羽ばたくのは、まだまだこれからだ！）", "zh": "（经历了Center公演，昴又成长了一些……\n想必今后她一定有机会展翅高飞！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
